      "reviews": [
        {
          "author_name": "Amina K.",
          "rating": 5,
          "body": "I've been hunting through GitHub release pages for months 😩 and this just puts everything in one place. Tapped install and it picked the right APK for my phone first time 🙌",
          "commented_on": "2026-09-02T00:00:00Z",
          "helpful_count": 41
        },
        {
          "author_name": "Tunde O.",
          "rating": 5,
          "body": "No ads. No tracking. No \"create an account\" nonsense. In 2026?? I had to double check I wasn't dreaming 😂",
          "commented_on": "2026-09-05T00:00:00Z",
          "helpful_count": 36
        },
        {
          "author_name": "Chidi E.",
          "rating": 5,
          "body": "Update notifications are the killer feature for me 🔔 Got pinged about a new release before I even knew one was coming. Never going back to manual checking.",
          "commented_on": "2026-09-08T00:00:00Z",
          "helpful_count": 28
        },
        {
          "author_name": "Fatima B.",
          "rating": 4,
          "body": "Dark mode is gorgeous 🌙 and the compare-two-apps view saved me from picking the wrong one. Only wish the trust score explained itself a bit more 🤔",
          "commented_on": "2026-09-11T00:00:00Z",
          "helpful_count": 19
        },
        {
          "author_name": "Emeka N.",
          "rating": 5,
          "body": "An update broke my favourite app and I nearly panicked 😬 then found the rollback option. Back to the old version in 10 seconds. You've earned a fan 💯",
          "commented_on": "2026-09-14T00:00:00Z",
          "helpful_count": 52
        },
        {
          "author_name": "Zainab L.",
          "rating": 3,
          "body": "Great idea, honestly, but a lot of listings have no screenshots 📷 and search crawled on my mobile data 🐌 Fix those and it's a 5 for me.",
          "commented_on": "2026-09-18T00:00:00Z",
          "helpful_count": 23
        },
        {
          "author_name": "David A.",
          "rating": 4,
          "body": "Synced my GitHub stars into favourites and my whole wishlist appeared instantly ✨ Would love more categories for dev tools.",
